     "textwithimage": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/tq-systems/qoriqr/TQMLS1012AL.jpeg",
      "imageRatio": "40",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "tqmls1012al board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on a Single Cortex-A53 LS1012A processor</h1>\r\n<p>The TQMLS1012A is an embedded module powered by a single Cortex-A53 processor variant, the LS1012A. With a clock speed of up to 1GHz, this module is designed for applications where a balance between power efficiency and processing capability is crucial. Equipped with up to 1GB of DDR3L memory, it ensures smooth and efficient data handling. It offers an array of communication interfaces, including two 10/100/1000 Mbit Ethernet ports, USB 2.0 and 3.0, UART RS232 ports, I2C, SPI, I2S, SATA 3.0, PCIe, and SDIO/MMC. The module operates in an extended temperature range of -40°C to +85°C, making it suitable for challenging environments.</p>\r\n",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 17 2026 19:24:00 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "altValueFromDAM": "false",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "1718154328384",
       "",
       ""
      ],
